Ravana seizes gods sages kings maidens en route --- Captives wail and curse death through woman --- Ravana enters Lanka honored by nightstalkers --- Widowed Shurpanakha falls at feet lamenting --- Ravana pleads battle frenzy and consoles sister --- Ravana grants Khara Dandaka with fourteen thousand troops --- Khara marches to Dandaka and rules thornless --- Shurpanakha dwells pleased in Dandaka forest
